  "description": "SRT (Secure Reliable Transport) listener and duplex-pipe transport for .NET, built on System.IO.Pipelines. Truly asynchronous accept, backpressure-aware receive driven by srt_epoll, and zero staging copies straight into pipe buffers. Fully self-contained: the native libsrt, statically linked with the mbedTLS crypto backend, ships inside the package for win-x64/arm64, linux-x64/arm64 and osx-arm64 - nothing to install. Ideal for ingesting live MPEG-TS streams.",
